en reviewed and supports the pickup locations and routes as compliant. These are valid trips and the documentation on file confirms as much. We request that both confirmations be approved in accordance with the supporting GPS evidence and applicable policy.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1863867110 - GPS Pickup Too Far from Residence (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the GPS Pickup Too Far from Residence flags on invoice 1863867110, covering Conf #14995055 and Conf #14995056 (both serviced 2026-04-20), and requesting that both trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor Conf #14995055 (Car 4892), GPS breadcrumb data is available and reasonably supports pickup at or near the member's residence. The flagged deviation does not reflect what actually occurred. For Conf #14995056 (Car 894), breadcrumb data similarly confirms a valid route from pickup to drop-off, consistent with an authorized trip completed as scheduled. In neither case does the GPS record indicate a true deviation.\\n\\nThe available breadcrumb data for both legs has been reviewed and supports the pickup locations and routes as compliant. These are valid trips and the documentation on file confirms as much. We request that both confirmations be approved in accordance with the supporting GPS evidence and applicable policy.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-12T14:27:21.033Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-12T14:28:02.795Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-12T14:27:21.033Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-14T12:16:38.795Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null