Deviation Status flags on invoice 1853169520, covering confirmation numbers 14991382 and 14991384, and requesting that both trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor Conf #14991382 (Car 934), the recorded travel time was reviewed and does reasonably support the distance traveled. While the system flagged the leg for travel time appearing too short, the timing data available for this trip provides an explainable basis for the discrepancy. This does not represent a true deviation from expected trip parameters.\\n\\nFor Conf #14991384 (Car 3185), GPS breadcrumb data is available and confirms a valid route from pickup to drop-off. The documented route is reasonable and directly supports that the trip was completed as authorized. The deviation flag does not reflect actual routing issues when the breadcrumb trail is taken into account.\\n\\nBoth trips are supported by available GPS and timing data that align with valid service completion. Based on this documentation, neither flag represents a true deviation, and we request that these claims be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-12T14:45:09.385Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-12T14:45:55.316Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-12T14:45:09.385Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-14T11:58:27.846Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closure