estationQueuedBy\":null,\"isOpen\":false,\"isTourSample\":false,\"withdrawnAt\":null,\"removedOfflineAt\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-28T14:38:53.050Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-14T11:59:12.797Z\"},\"attestationOutcome\":\"attested\",\"outcomeAt\":\"2026-05-14T11:59:12.797Z\",\"outcomeBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"outcomeNote\":null}]},{\"group\":{\"id\":1051,\"invoiceNumber\":\"1869194970\",\"clientNumber\":\"VB34585D\",\"errorDetails\":\"Leg is in GPS Deviation Status.; GPS pickup too far from residence\",\"errorTypeId\":\"6\",\"errorTypeName\":\"GPS Deviation Status\",\"status\":\"Resolved\",\"outcome\":\"Approved\",\"phase\":\"closed\",\"phaseEnteredAt\":\"2026-05-14T11:41:47.048Z\",\"approvedAmount\":\"95.86\",\"rideCount\":2,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-04-27\",\"totalAmount\":\"95.86\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1869194970 - GPS Deviation Status (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"**Dispute – GPS Deviation Status – Invoice #1869194970 | Conf #15055825 & #15055823**\\n\\nWe are disputing the GPS Deviation flags on both rides under invoice #1869194970 and requesting reconsideration for Conf #15055825 and Conf #15055823, both serviced on 2026-04-27.\\n\\nFor Conf #15055825 (Car 4770), GPS breadcrumb data is available and the recorded route reasonably supports a valid trip from pickup to drop-off. The deviation flag does not reflect actual trip performance. For Conf #15055823 (Car 3079), breadcrumb data similarly confirms that the pickup location is reasonably supported relative to the member's residence, making the \\\"GPS pickup too far from residence\\\" edit inapplicable.\\n\\nIn both cases, the available GPS data aligns with trip completion as authorized. The flags appear to result from threshold tolerances rather than any true deviation in service. Based on the documented GPS evidence for each confirmation, these are valid trips and we request that both claims be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1869194970 - GPS Deviation Status (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Dispute – GPS Deviation Status – Invoice #1869194970 | Conf #15055825 & #15055823**\\n\\nWe are disputing the GPS Deviation flags on both rides under invoice #1869194970 and requesting reconsideration for Conf #15055825 and Conf #15055823, both serviced on 2026-04-27.\\n\\nFor Conf #15055825 (Car 4770), GPS breadcrumb data is available and the recorded route reasonably supports a valid trip from pickup to drop-off. The deviation flag does not reflect actual trip performance. For Conf #15055823 (Car 3079), breadcrumb data similarly confirms that the pickup location is reasonably supported relative to the member's residence, making the \\\"GPS pickup too far from residence\\\" edit inapplicable.\\n\\nIn both cases, the available GPS data aligns with trip completion as authorized. The flags appear to result from threshold tolerances rather than any true deviation in service. Based on the documented GPS evidence for each confirmation, these are valid trips and we request that both claims be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T19:04:52.770Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T19:04:57.592Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-09T19:04:52.770Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-14T11:41:47.017Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closur