d Conf #14951807 (both serviced 2026-04-08), and requesting that both trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor each of these rides, available GPS and trip timing data was reviewed and does not support the denial. The recorded facility stay timing is reasonable given the nature of the appointment and is not indicative of an incomplete or improper trip. The flag does not reflect a true deviation from expected service delivery.\\n\\nThe attached timing data for both confirmation numbers confirms that each trip was completed as authorized. Based on this documentation, these are valid trips and we request that both claims be approved in accordance with applicable guidelines.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1860437800 - Time at Medical Facility Too Short (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Reconsideration Request – Time at Medical Facility Too Short – Invoice #1860437800**\\n\\nWe are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\\\" flag on invoice #1860437800, covering Conf #14951806 and Conf #14951807 (both serviced 2026-04-08), and requesting that both trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor each of these rides, available GPS and trip timing data was reviewed and does not support the denial. The recorded facility stay timing is reasonable given the nature of the appointment and is not indicative of an incomplete or improper trip. The flag does not reflect a true deviation from expected service delivery.\\n\\nThe attached timing data for both confirmation numbers confirms that each trip was completed as authorized. Based on this documentation, these are valid trips and we request that both claims be approved in accordance with applicable guidelines.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-07T22:19:29.468Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-07T22:19:32.446Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understan