pproved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":[{\"paragraph\":\"We are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flag on Conf #15106599 and requesting that this claim be reconsidered for approval. The deviation flag does not reflect what actually occurred on this trip — the GPS data collected for this run supports a valid route from pickup to drop-off, and there is no basis for treating this as a true deviation.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"},{\"paragraph\":\"The available GPS breadcrumb data was reviewed through the standard SOP workflow, and the route traced by vehicle 3079 on 2026-05-07 was confirmed to reasonably align with the expected path between the member's pickup and destination. This confirmation directly contradicts the deviation flag and establishes that the trip was completed as intended.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"},{\"paragraph\":\"Based on the GPS documentation on file, this is a valid, completed trip and we request that invoice 1873596520 be approved accordingly.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"}],\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:54:43.262Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:54:55.473Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:54:43.262Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":false,\"reattestCompletedAt\":null,\"reattestCompletedBy\":null,\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":null,\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":nu