1/2026), and requesting that these trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor both rides, available GPS and trip timing data was reviewed and does not support the flagged concern. The timing data reasonably reflects the actual duration of the member's facility stay and does not indicate an abnormally short visit. The edit does not reflect a true deviation for either trip.\\n\\nThe attached trip timing records confirm that the documented facility time is consistent with a completed, legitimate transport. Based on the available data and applicable guidelines, both trips were performed as authorized and should be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-20T19:40:13.106Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-20T19:40:21.509Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-20T19:40:13.106Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:34:54.272Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"Grace@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":true,\"disputeEmailSentAt\":\"2026-05-20T22:55:54.267Z\",\"generatedEmailSubject\":null,\"generatedEmailBody\":null,\"generatedEmailAt\":null,\"evidenceFiles\":null,\"evidenceNotes\":null,\"evidenceChecklist\":null,\"payorEmail\":null,\"payorDenialReason\":null,\"payorDenialReasonNote\":null,\"payorDenialReasonAt\":null,\"payorDenialReasonBy\":null,\"awaitingPayorAgainAt\":\"2026-05-22T12:30:43.716Z\",\"importBatch\":\"import_1777910004826\",\"isTourSample\":false,\"withdrawnAt\":null,\"draftDiscardedAt\":null,\"draftDiscardedSubject\":null,\"draftDiscardedDescriptionHtml\":null,\"isOpen\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-04T15:53:28.928Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:34:54.337Z\"},{\"id\":1386,\"invoiceNumber\":\"1803117430\",\"clientNumber\":\"ZN62974D\",\"errorDetails\":\"GPS pickup too far from residence\",\"errorTypeId\":\"6\",\"errorTypeName\":\"GPS Deviation Status\",\"status\":\"Portal Queued\",\"outcome\":\"Pending\",\"phase\":\"submitted\",\"phaseEnteredAt\":\"2026-05-08T16:00:28.793Z\",\"approvedAmount\":null,\"rideCount\":2,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-05-07\",\"totalAmount\":\"62.74\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1803117430 - GPS Deviation Status (1 ride)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flag on Conf #15094480 (Invoice 1803117430) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered and approved.\\n\\nThe deviation flag does not reflect actual trip performance. GPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and confirms that the route traveled reasonably supports a valid trip from the assigned pickup to drop-off location. There is no evidence of a true deviation from the authorized route.\\n\\nThe available GPS data directly addresses the basis for this flag and demonstrates that the trip was completed as intended. Based on this documentation, Conf #15094480 represents a valid, completed trip and should be approved in accordance with applicable guidelines.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1803117430 - GPS Deviation Status (1 ride)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flag on Conf #15094480 (Invoice 1803117430) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered and approved.\\n\\nThe deviation flag does not reflect actual trip performance. GPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and confirms that the route traveled reasonably supports a valid trip from the assigned pickup to drop-off location. There is no evidence of a true deviation from the authorized route.\\n\\nThe available GPS data directly addresses the basis for this flag and demonstrates that the trip was completed as intended. Based on this documentation, Conf #15094480 represents a valid, completed trip and should be approved in accordance with applicable guidelines.\",\"draftAttribution\":[{\"paragraph\":\"We are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flag on Conf #15094480 (Invoice 1803117430) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered and approved.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"},{\"paragraph\":\"The deviation flag does not reflect actual trip performance. GPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and confirms that the route traveled reasonably supports a valid trip from the assigned pickup to drop-off location. There is no evidence of a true deviation from the authorized route.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"},{\"paragraph\":\"The available GPS data directly addresses the basis for this flag and demonstrates that the trip was completed as intended. Based on this documentation, Conf #15094480 represents a valid, completed trip and should be approved in accordance with applicable guidelines.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"}],\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:31:09.234Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:31:25.164Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:31:09.234Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":false,\"reattestCompletedAt\":null,\"reattestCompletedBy\":null,\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":null,\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":false,\"disputeEmailSentAt\":null,\"generatedEmailSubject\":null,\"generatedEmailBody\":null,\"generatedEmailAt\":null,\"evidenceFiles\":null,\"evidenceNotes\":null,\"evidenceChecklist\":null,\"payorEmail\":null,\"payorDenialReason\":null,\"payorDenialReasonNote\":null,\"payorDenialReasonAt\":null,\"payorDenialReasonBy\":null,\"awaitingPayorAgainAt\":null,\"importBatch\":\"import_1778256021982\",\"isTourSample\":false,\"withdrawnAt\":null,\"draftDiscardedAt\":null,\"draftDiscardedSubject\":null,\"draftDiscardedDescriptionHtml\":null,\"isOpen\":true,\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-08T16:00:28.793Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:31:52.207Z\"},{\"id\":1388,\"invoiceNumber\":\"1872342440\",\"clientNumber\":\"VK81768K\",\"errorDetails\":\"GPS pickup too far from medical facility\",\"errorTypeId\":\"6\",\"errorTypeName\":\"GPS Deviation Status\",\"status\":\"Portal Queued\",\"outcome\":\"Pending\",\"phase\":\"submitted\",\"phaseEnteredAt\":\"2026-05-08T16:00:28.976Z\",\"approvedAmount\":null,\"rideCount\":2,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-05-07\",\"totalAmount\":\"128.48\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1872342440 - GPS Deviation Status (1 ride)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flag for Conf #15094061 (Invoice 1872342440) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered and approved.\\n\\nThe denial does not reflect a true deviation. The root cause here is a known display error in which the On Location pinpoint appears near the drop-off point rather than in front of the pickup location, creating a misleading visual in the route evidence. This is a system-side rendering issue, not a problem with how the trip was actually performed.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and confirms that the driver traveled the correct route, serving the right pickup and drop-off locations. The breadcrumb trail is the reliable record of what occurred on the ground, and it fully supports valid trip completion regardless of the pinpoint display error.\\n\\nBased on the breadcrumb data and the documented pinpoint display issue, this trip was completed as authorized and the deviation flag is not warranted. We request that this claim be approved in accordance with the supporting documentation.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1872342440 - GPS Deviation Status (1 ride)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flag for Conf #15094061 (Invoice 1872342440) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered and approved.\\n\\nThe denial does not reflect a true deviation. The root cause here is a known display error in which the On Location pinpoint appears near the drop-off point rather than in front of the pickup location, creating a misleading visual in the route evidence. This is a system-side rendering issue, not a problem with how the trip was actually performed.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and confirms that the driver traveled the correct route, serving the right pickup and drop-off locations. The breadcrumb trail is the reliable record of what occurred on the ground, and it fully supports valid trip completion regardless of the pinpoint display error.\\n\\nBased on the breadcrumb data and the documented pinpoint display issue, this trip was completed as authorized and the deviation flag is not warranted. We request that this claim be approved in accordance with the supporting documentation.\",\"draftAttribution\":[{\"paragraph\":\"We are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flag for Conf #15094061 (Invoice 1872342440) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered and approved.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"},{\"paragraph\":\"The denial does not reflect a true deviation. The root cause here is a known display error in which the On Location pinpoint appears near the drop-off point rather than in front of the pickup location, creating a misleading visual in the route evidence. This is a system-side rendering issue, not a problem with how the trip was actually performed.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"},{\"paragraph\":\"GPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and confirms that the driver traveled the correct route, serving the right pickup and drop-off locations. The breadcrumb trail is the reliable record of what occurred on the ground, and it fully supports valid trip completion regardless of the pinpoint display error.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"},{\"paragraph\":\"Based on the breadcrumb data and the documented pinpoint display issue, this trip was completed as authorized and the deviation flag is not warranted. We request that this claim be approved in accordance with the supporting documentation.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"}],\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:27:49.858Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:28:28.113Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":\"For confirmation number 15094061, a system glitch is causing the On Location pinpoint shown in the route evidence to appear near the drop-off location rather than in front of the pickup location, which misrepresents what actually happened. However, the breadcrumb data shows that the driver did in fact pick up and drop off the passenger at the correct locations. No ambiguities are present; the note is clear that the pinpoint display error is a known technical issue and the breadcrumbs are being cited as the reliable evidence.\",\"understandingReadbackForText\":\"For Conf #15094061, a system glitch is allowing the On Location pinpoint presented in the route evidence to show near the Drop Off instead of in front of the Pickup Location. The breadcrumbs demonstrate that the driver picked up and dropped off at the correct locations.\",\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:27:49.858Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":false,\"reattestCompletedAt\":null,\"reattestCompletedBy\":null,\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":null,\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":false,\"disputeEmailSentAt\":null,\"generatedEmailSubject\":null,\"generatedEmailBody\":null,\"generatedEmailAt\":null,\"evidenceFiles\":null,\"evidenceNotes\":null,\"evidenceChecklist\":null,\"payorEmail\":null,\"payorDenialReason\":null,\"payorDenialReasonNote\":null,\"payorDenialReasonAt\":null,\"payorDenialReasonBy\":null,\"awaitingPayorAgainAt\":null,\"importBatch\":\"import_1778256021982\",\"isTourSample\":