te\":\"2026-04-28\",\"totalAmount\":\"139.28\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1856909340 - Time at Medical Facility Too Short (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\\\" flag on invoice 1856909340, covering Conf #15036839 and Conf #15036836, both serviced on 04/28/2026, and requesting that these claims be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor both trips, GPS and timing data are available and were reviewed through our workflow. Neither trip reflects a facility stay that appears shorter than expected. The timing data reasonably supports the duration of each visit, meaning the flag does not represent a true deviation from expected service patterns.\\n\\nThe available trip timing records are attached and confirm that the time spent at the medical facility aligns with a legitimate, completed trip for each confirmation. Based on this documentation, both rides were performed as authorized and should be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1856909340 - Time at Medical Facility Too Short (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\\\" flag on invoice 1856909340, covering Conf #15036839 and Conf #15036836, both serviced on 04/28/2026, and requesting that these claims be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor both trips, GPS and timing data are available and were reviewed through our workflow. Neither trip reflects a facility stay that appears shorter than expected. The timing data reasonably supports the duration of each visit, meaning the flag does not represent a true deviation from expected service patterns.\\n\\nThe available trip timing records are attached and confirm that the time spent at the medical facility aligns with a legitimate, completed trip for each confirmation. Based on this documentation, both rides were performed as authorized and should be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":