\",\"approvedAmount\":\"110.02\",\"rideCount\":2,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-04-28\",\"totalAmount\":\"110.02\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1869876820 - Time at Medical Facility Too Short (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\\\" flag on invoice 1869876820 and requesting reconsideration of both affected trips, Conf #15065548 and Conf #15065549, serviced on 04/28/2026.\\n\\nFor both confirmations, GPS and trip timing data are available and have been reviewed. That data does not support the denial. The recorded facility time for each trip is consistent with a legitimate appointment and does not reflect an unusually short or questionable stay. The flag does not accurately represent what occurred on these trips.\\n\\nThe available timing data is submitted in support of this dispute. It confirms that both trips proceeded as authorized and that the time at the medical facility aligns reasonably with a completed appointment. Based on this documentation, these are valid, completed trips and we request that they be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1869876820 - Time at Medical Facility Too Short (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\\\" flag on invoice 1869876820 and requesting reconsideration of both affected trips, Conf #15065548 and Conf #15065549, serviced on 04/28/2026.\\n\\nFor both confirmations, GPS and trip timing data are available and have been reviewed. That data does not support the denial. The recorded facility time for each trip is consistent with a legitimate appointment and does not reflect an unusually short or questionable stay. The flag does not accurately represent what occurred on these trips.\\n\\nThe available timing data is submitted in support of this dispute. It confirms that both trips proceeded as authorized and that the time at the medical facility aligns reason