requesting reconsideration of both affected trips, Conf #14900728 and Conf #14900727, both serviced on 04/06/2026 under vehicle 2128.\\n\\nGPS and trip timing data is available for both rides and was reviewed through our SOP workflow. In both cases, the timing data reasonably supports the facility stay duration -- the flagged edit does not reflect a true deviation from expected service patterns. The denial appears to be based on an automated threshold that does not account for the documented circumstances of these trips.\\n\\nWe are prepared to submit supporting facility timing evidence upon request. Based on the available data and applicable guidelines, both trips were completed as authorized and should be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-06T14:20:05.968Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-06T14:20:11.745Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-06T14:20:05.968Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-07T22:24:28.455Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":null,\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":true,\"disputeEmailSen