documentation, this is a valid trip and we request that it be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1880970700 - Incomplete GPS (1 ride)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the Incomplete GPS flag on Conf #15188708 (Invoice 1880970700) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and is sufficient to support completion of the service. The denial does not reflect a true deviation, as the route data captured for Car 5244 on 05/18/2026 reasonably documents the trip from origin to destination without meaningful gaps that would call the service into question.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb data confirms that the trip was performed as authorized. Based on this documentation, this is a valid trip and we request that it be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-20T12:50:54.056Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-20T12:50:57.457Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-20T12:50:54.056Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:53:09.476Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"Grace@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":true,\"disputeEmailSentAt\":\"2026-05-20T15:06:20.462Z\",\"generatedEmailSubject\":null,\"generatedEmailBody\":null,\"generatedEmailAt\":null,\"evidenceFiles\":null,\"evidenceNotes\":null,\"evidenceChecklist\":null,\"payorEmail\":null,\"payorDenialReason\":null,\"payorDenialReasonNote\":null,\"payorDenialReasonAt\":null,\"payorDenialReasonBy\":null,\"awaitingPayorAgainAt\":\"2026-05-22T12:29:10.031Z\",\"importBatch\":\"import_1779201725402\",\"isTourSample\":false,\"withdrawnAt\":null,\"draftDiscardedAt\":null,\"draftDiscardedSubject\":null,\"draftDiscardedDescriptionHtml\":null,\"isOpen\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-19T14:42:05.923Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:53:09.546Z\"},{\"id\":1383,\"invoiceNumber\":\"1824879190\",\"clientNumber\":\"BC47554C\",\"errorDetails\":\"MAS: Ineligible enrolee\",\"errorTypeId\":\"12\",\"errorTypeName\":\"Ineligible Enrollee\",\"status\":\"Portal Queued\",\"outcome\":\"Pending\",\"phase\":\"submitted\",\"phaseEnteredAt\":\"2026-05-08T16:00:28.538Z\",\"approvedAmount\":null,\"rideCount\":1,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-05-07\",\"totalAmount\":\"45.39\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1824879190 - Ineligible Enrollee (1 ride)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Ineligible Enrollee\\\" denial for Conf #15095420 on Invoice 1824879190 and requesting that this claim be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nThe service for member BC47554C was fully completed on 05/07/2026 before any cancellation action by MAS. Because the trip was already underway and finished before the cancellation was applied, an eligibility flag at the point of cancellation does not reflect the circumstances under which service was rendered. The provider fulfilled their obligation, and the member did travel.\\n\\nGPS data, the Limosys job activity log, and the Limosys prevalidation screenshot are all available and attached to support this claim. The GPS records confirm the route and completion of the trip, and the prevalidation screenshot shows the trip was authorized at the time of dispatch. Taken together, these materials demonstrate that service was legitimately provided.\\n\\nBased on the documentation provided and the fact that the service was completed as dispatched, this is a valid trip, and we request that the claim be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1824879190 - Ineligible Enrollee (1 ride)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Ineligible Enrollee\\\" denial for Conf #15095420 on Invoice 1824879190 and requesting that this claim be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nThe service for member BC47554C was fully completed on 05/07/2026 prior to any cancellation action by MAS. Because the trip was already underway and finished before the cancellation was applied, an eligibility flag at the point of cancellation does not reflect the circumstances under which service was rendered. The provider fulfilled their obligation, and the member did travel.\\n\\nGPS data, a signed receipt, and the Limosys prevalidation screenshot are all available and attached to support this claim. The GPS records confirm the route and completion of the trip, the signed receipt documents member participation, and the prevalidation screenshot shows the trip was authorized at the time of dispatch. Taken together, these materials demonstrate that service was legitimately provided.\\n\\nBased on the documentation provided and the fact that service was completed as dispatched, this is a valid trip and we request that the claim be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":[{\"paragraph\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Ineligible Enrollee\\\" denial for Conf #15095420 on Invoice 1824879190 and requesting that this claim be reconsidered for approval.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"},{\"paragraph\":\"The service for member BC47554C was fully completed on 05/07/2026 prior to any cancellation action by MAS. Because the trip was already underway and finished before the cancellation was applied, an eligibility flag at the point of cancellation does not reflect the circumstances under which service was rendered. The provider fulfilled their obligation, and the member did travel.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"},{\"paragraph\":\"GPS data, a signed receipt, and the Limosys prevalidation screenshot are all available and attached to support this claim. The GPS records confirm the route and completion of the trip, the signed receipt documents member participation, and the prevalidation screenshot shows the trip was authorized at the time of dispatch. Taken together, these materials demonstrate that service was legitimately provided.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"},{\"paragraph\":\"Based on the documentation provided and the fact that service was completed as dispatched, this is a valid trip and we request that the claim be approved accordingly.\",\"sourceRef\":null,\"sourceKind\":\"composed\"}],\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:52:45.529Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:52:50.629Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:51:51.843Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":false,\"reattestCompletedAt\":null,\"reattestCompletedBy\":null,\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":null,\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"c