oo Short, a system glitch is causing the On Location pinpoint displayed in the route evidence to appear near the Drop Off location rather than in front of the Pickup Location. The breadcrumb data, however, demonstrates that the driver picked up and dropped off the member at the correct locations.\",\"duplicateOfClaimId\":null,\"masActionRequired\":\"none\",\"masActionCompletedAt\":null,\"masActionCompletedBy\":null,\"masActionNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":null,\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"attestationState\":\"queued\",\"attestedAt\":null,\"attestedBy\":null,\"attestationNote\":\"1. Re-attest the invoice.\",\"attestationQueuedAt\":\"2026-05-22T12:24:00.503Z\",\"attestationQueuedBy\":\"daniel.m@agapeny.com\",\"isOpen\":false,\"isTourSample\":false,\"withdrawnAt\":null,\"removedOfflineAt\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-30T15:09:08.686Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-26T14:49:29.528Z\"},\"attestationOutcome\":\"queued\",\"outcomeAt\":\"2026-05-22T12:24:00.503Z\",\"outcomeBy\":\"daniel.m@agapeny.com\",\"outcomeNote\":\"1. Re-attest the invoice.\"}]},{\"group\":{\"id\":1113,\"invoiceNumber\":\"1856909340\",\"clientNumber\":\"EC74617K\",\"errorDetails\":\"Time at medical facility too short\",\"errorTypeId\":\"7\",\"errorTypeName\":\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\",\"status\":\"Resolved\",\"outcome\":\"Approved\",\"phase\":\"closed\",\"phaseEnteredAt\":\"2026-05-26T14:45:22.020Z\",\"approvedAmount\":\"139.28\",\"rideCount\":2,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-04-28\",\"totalAmount\":\"139.28\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1856909340 - Time at Medical Facility Too Short (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\\\" flag on invoice 1856909340, covering Conf #15036839 and Conf #15036836, both serviced on 04/28/2026, and requesting that these claims be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor both trips, GPS and timing data are available and were reviewed through our workflow. Neither trip reflects a facility stay that appears shorter than expected. The timing data reasonably supports the duration of each visit, meaning the flag does not represent a true deviation from expected service patterns.\\n\\nThe available trip timing records are attached and confirm that the time spent at the medical facility aligns with a legitimate, completed trip for each confirmation. Based on this documentation, both rides were performed as authorized and should be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1856909340 - Time at Medical Facility Too Short (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\\\" flag on invoice 1856909340, covering Conf #15036839 and Conf #15036836, both serviced on 04/28/2026, and requesting that these claims be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor both trips, GPS and timing data are available and were reviewed through our workflow. Neither trip reflects a facility stay that appears shorter than expected. The timing data reasonably supports the duration of each visit, meaning the flag does not represent a true deviation from expected service patterns.\\n\\nThe available trip timing records are attached and confirm that the time spent at the medical facility aligns with a legitimate, completed trip for each confirmation. Based on this documentation, both rides were performed as authorized and should be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":