ecords, dispatch history, and a signed receipt are available to confirm trip completion. A Correction Request has been initiated through the MAS portal for this invoice, and supporting documentation is attached. Based on the evidence on file, this is a legitimate completed trip and we request that it be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1866413320 - Invoice Number Not in System (1 ride)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Invoice Number Not in System\\\" flag for invoice 1866413320 (Conf #15022597, service date 04/20/2026) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered and approved for submission.\\n\\nThe denial indicates that this invoice number is not recognized in the MAS system; however, the trip was completed as authorized prior to any cancellation on MAS's end. This is not a true billing deviation — the service was rendered and the invoice is valid.\\n\\nGPS records, dispatch history, and a signed receipt are available to confirm trip completion. A Correction Request has been initiated through the MAS portal for this invoice, and supporting documentation is attached. Based on the evidence on file, this is a legitimate completed trip and we request that it be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-15T17:46:36.607Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-15T17:46:41.010Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-15T17:46:36.607Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-18T14:13:11.009Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"clos