ing data was reviewed through our workflow process, and in each case the facility stay duration reasonably supports the trip as completed. The flagged edit does not reflect a true deviation for either confirmation. The timing recorded is consistent with a legitimate medical appointment and does not indicate an incomplete or insufficient visit.\\n\\nThe trip timing data on file for both confirmations supports this position. Based on that documentation and the applicable guidelines, these are valid trips and we request that both claims be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1869348250 - Time at Medical Facility Too Short (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\\\" flag on invoice 1869348250, covering Conf #15057751 and Conf #15057752 (both serviced on 04/25/2026), and requesting that these claims be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor both trips, available GPS and timing data was reviewed through our workflow process, and in each case the facility stay duration reasonably supports the trip as completed. The flagged edit does not reflect a true deviation for either confirmation. The timing recorded is consistent with a legitimate medical appointment and does not indicate an incomplete or insufficient visit.\\n\\nThe trip timing data on file for both confirmations supports this position. Based on that documentation and the applicable guidelines, these are valid trips and we request that both claims be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:06:08.034Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:06:08.034Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:06:08.034Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"emil.j@agape