oes not represent a true deviation for either confirmation.\\n\\nThe trip timing data on file supports that both rides were completed as authorized. Based on this documentation, these are valid trips and we request that both claims be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1869415480 - Time at Medical Facility Too Short (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\\\" flag on invoice 1869415480, covering Conf #15061895 and Conf #15061896 (both serviced on 04/25/2026), and requesting that these claims be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor both trips, available GPS and timing data was reviewed and does not support the denial. The recorded facility dwell time is reasonable given the nature of the appointments, and the timing data does not reflect a legitimately short stay. This flag does not represent a true deviation for either confirmation.\\n\\nThe trip timing data on file supports that both rides were completed as authorized. Based on this documentation, these are valid trips and we request that both claims be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:05:59.470Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:05:59.470Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:05:59.470Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-14T15:48:25.074Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOt