7120) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nThe denial does not reflect the actual state of the trip data. GPS breadcrumb data is available for this service date of 04/26/2026 and is sufficient to reasonably support trip completion. The route recorded is consistent with the authorized transport, and there is no gap or anomaly in the data that would indicate the trip was not performed as scheduled.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb data confirms pickup, route progression, and drop-off for this trip. Based on this documentation, the Incomplete GPS edit does not represent a true deviation, and we request that this claim be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:07:11.339Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:07:11.339Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:07:11.339Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-14T15:18:41.765Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":true,\"disputeEmailSentAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:34:34.555Z\",\"generatedEmai