ject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1859800670 - GPS Deviation Status (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"Dispute – GPS Deviation Status – Invoice #1859800670 | Conf #15027801 & #15027802\\n\\nWe are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flags on both rides under invoice #1859800670 and requesting reconsideration for Conf #15027801 and Conf #15027802, both serviced on 2026-04-27.\\n\\nFor Conf #15027801 (Car 4083), GPS breadcrumb data is available, and the recorded route reasonably supports a valid trip between the designated pickup and drop-off locations. The flagged deviation does not reflect an actual service failure. For Conf #15027802 (Car 464), breadcrumb data similarly confirms that the pickup occurred at or near the member's residence, which directly contradicts the \\\"GPS pickup too far from residence\\\" edit.\\n\\nThe available GPS data for both trips has been reviewed and supports valid, completed service in each case. These flags appear to have been triggered without accounting for the full route evidence on record. Based on the documentation, both trips were performed as authorized and we request that they be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1859800670 - GPS Deviation Status (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Dispute – GPS Deviation Status – Invoice #1859800670 | Conf #15027801 & #15027802**\\n\\nWe are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flags on both rides under invoice #1859800670 and requesting reconsideration for Conf #15027801 and Conf #15027802, both serviced on 2026-04-27.\\n\\nFor Conf #15027801 (Car 4083), GPS breadcrumb data is available and the recorded route reasonably supports a valid trip between the designated pickup and dropoff locations. The flagged deviation does not reflect an actual service failure. For Conf #15027802 (Car 464), breadcrumb data similarly confirms that the pickup occurred at or near the member's residence, which directly contradicts the \\\"GPS pickup too far from residence\\\" edit.\\n\\nThe available GPS data for both trips has been reviewed and supports valid, completed service in each case. These flags appear to have been triggered without accounting for the full route evidence on record. Based on the documentation, both trips were performed as authorized and we request that they be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T18:32:41.112Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T18:32:43.153Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-09T18:32:21.058Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-14T15:05:42.496Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":true,\"disputeEmailSentAt\":\"2026-05-09T21:37:50.084Z\",\"generatedEmailSubject\":null,\"generatedEmailBody\":null,\"generatedEmailAt\":null,\"evidenceFiles\":null,\"evidenceNotes\":null,\"evidenceChecklist\":null,\"payorEmail\":null,\"payorDenialReason\":null,\"payorDenialReasonNote\":null,\"payorDenialReasonAt\":null,\"payorDenialReasonBy\":null,\"awaitingPayorAgainAt\":\"2026-05-14T12:26:17.277Z\",\"imp