GPS Pickup Too Far from Residence (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the GPS Pickup Too Far from Residence flags on invoice 1842066700, covering Conf #15027917 and Conf #15027916, both serviced on 2026-04-27, and requesting that these trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor Conf #15027917 (Car 3692), GPS breadcrumb data is available and reasonably supports pickup at or near the member's residence. The flag does not reflect a true deviation; the breadcrumb trail places the vehicle at a location consistent with the authorized pickup address. For Conf #15027916 (Car 4828), GPS data is likewise available and confirms a valid route from pickup to drop-off. The route is reasonable and consistent with a completed, authorized trip.\\n\\nThe available GPS breadcrumb data for both legs directly contradicts the deviation status applied to this invoice. Based on this documentation, both trips were completed as authorized and these claims should be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1842066700 - GPS Pickup Too Far from Residence (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the GPS Pickup Too Far from Residence flags on invoice 1842066700, covering Conf #15027917 and Conf #15027916, both serviced on 2026-04-27, and requesting that these trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor Conf #15027917 (Car 3692), GPS breadcrumb data is available and reasonably supports pickup at or near the member's residence. The flag does not reflect a true deviation; the breadcrumb trail places the vehicle at a location consistent with the authorized pickup address. For Conf #15027916 (Car 4828), GPS data is likewise available and confirms a valid route from pickup to drop-off. The route is reasonable and consistent with a completed, authorized trip.\\n\\nThe available GPS breadcrumb data for both legs directly contradicts the deviation status applied to this invoice. Based on this documentation, both trips were completed as authorized and these claims should be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:08:45.486Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:08:45.486Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:08:45.486Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-14T14:50:55.300Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":true,\"disputeEmailSentAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:38:13.004Z\",\"generatedEmailSubject\":null,\"generatedEmailBody\":null,\"generatedEmailAt\":null,\"evidenceFiles\":null,\"evidenceNotes\":null,\"evidenceChecklist\":null,\"payorEmail\":null,\"payorDenialReason\":null,\"payorDenialReasonNote\":null,\"payorDenialReasonAt\":null,\"payorDenialReasonBy\":null,\"awaitingPayorAgainAt\":\"2026-05-14T12:36:21.883Z\",\"importBatch\":\"import_1777387119750\",\"isTourSample\":false,\"withdrawnAt\":null,\"draftDiscardedAt\":null,\"draftDiscardedSubject\":null,\"draftDiscardedDescriptionHtml\":null,\"isOpen\":false,\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-28T14:39:03.518Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-14T14:50:55.362Z\"},