\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"**Reconsideration Request – Incomplete GPS – Invoice #1833679120**\\n\\nWe are disputing the Incomplete GPS flag on invoice 1833679120, covering confirmation numbers 14929270 and 14929272 (both serviced on 04/10/2026 by vehicle 1062), and requesting that these trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for both trips and is sufficient to reasonably support completion of each run. The denial does not reflect a true deviation -- the data was captured and intact, and the route traveled aligns with what was authorized.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb records for both confirmations demonstrate that vehicle 1062 completed the trips as dispatched. Based on the available documentation, these are valid completed trips and should be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1833679120 - Incomplete GPS (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Reconsideration Request – Incomplete GPS – Invoice #1833679120**\\n\\nWe are disputing the Incomplete GPS flag on invoice 1833679120, covering confirmation numbers 14929270 and 14929272 (both serviced on 04/10/2026 by vehicle 1062), and requesting that these trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for both trips and is sufficient to reasonably support completion of each run. The denial does not reflect a true deviation -- the data was captured and intact, and the route traveled aligns with what was authorized.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb records for both confirmations demonstrate that vehicle 1062 completed the trips as dispatched. Based on the available documentation, these are valid completed trips and should be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-07T22:32:11.120Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"daniel.m@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-07T22:32:13.631Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"daniel.m@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"underst