.748Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-12T15:02:17.448Z\"},\"attestationOutcome\":\"mas_cancelled\",\"outcomeAt\":\"2026-05-12T14:57:40.525Z\",\"outcomeBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"outcomeNote\":null}]},{\"group\":{\"id\":354,\"invoiceNumber\":\"1849951770\",\"clientNumber\":\"XC04975E\",\"errorDetails\":\"Time at medical facility too long\",\"errorTypeId\":\"8\",\"errorTypeName\":\"Time at Medical Facility Too Long\",\"status\":\"Resolved\",\"outcome\":\"Approved\",\"phase\":\"closed\",\"phaseEnteredAt\":\"2026-05-12T14:51:41.557Z\",\"approvedAmount\":\"60.10\",\"rideCount\":2,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-04-07\",\"totalAmount\":\"60.10\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1849951770 - Time at Medical Facility Too Long (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"Reconsideration Request – Time at Medical Facility Too Long – Invoice #1849951770\\n\\nWe are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Long\\\" flag on invoice #1849951770 and requesting reconsideration for Conf #14908305 and Conf #14908302, both serviced on 2026-04-07.\\n\\nGPS and trip timing data are available for both rides and were reviewed against the flag criteria. In each case, the timing data does not support the conclusion that the member spent an excessive amount of time at the facility. The recorded facility dwell times are consistent with the nature of the appointment and fall within a reasonable range given normal variation in medical visit duration.\\n\\nThe attached timing data for both trips confirms that the flagged durations reflect actual, documented service and do not represent a true deviation. Based on this documentation, both trips were completed as authorized and we request that these claims be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1849951770 - Time at Medical Facility Too Long (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Reconsideration Request – Time at Medical Facility Too Long – Invoice #1849951770**\\n\\nWe are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Long\\\" flag on invoice #1849951770 and requesting reconsideration for Conf #14908305 and Conf #14908302, both serviced on 2026-04-07.\\n\\nGPS and trip timing data are available for both rides and were reviewed against the flag criteria. In each case, the timing data does not support the conclusion that the member spent an excessive amount of time at the facility. The recorded facility dwell times are consistent with the nature of the appointment and fall within a reasonable range given normal variation in medical visit duration.\\n\\nThe attached timing data for both trips confirms that the flagged durations reflect actual, documented service and do not represent a true deviation. Based on this documentation, both trips were completed as authorized and we request that these claims be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-07T21:44:24.716Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-07T21:44:33.101Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-07T21:41:26.804Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-12T14:51:41.523Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressed