d trip and we request that it be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1880970700 - Incomplete GPS (1 ride)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the Incomplete GPS flag on Conf #15188708 (Invoice 1880970700) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and is sufficient to support completion of the service. The denial does not reflect a true deviation, as the route data captured for Car 5244 on 05/18/2026 reasonably documents the trip from origin to destination without meaningful gaps that would call the service into question.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb data confirms that the trip was performed as authorized. Based on this documentation, this is a valid trip and we request that it be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-20T12:50:54.056Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-20T12:50:57.457Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-20T12:50:54.056Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:53:09.476Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"Grace@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\"