S support is sufficient\",\"nodeId\":\"node_1776176538080_9\"}],\"sopOutcome\":\"portal_dispute\",\"dropReason\":null,\"dropNote\":null,\"droppedAt\":null,\"readyAt\":\"2026-05-20T12:50:46.016Z\",\"perLegContext\":null,\"duplicateOfClaimId\":null,\"masActionRequired\":\"none\",\"masActionCompletedAt\":null,\"masActionCompletedBy\":null,\"masActionNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":null,\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"attestationState\":\"queued\",\"attestedAt\":null,\"attestedBy\":null,\"attestationNote\":\"1. Re-attest the invoice.\",\"attestationQueuedAt\":\"2026-05-22T12:29:10.031Z\",\"attestationQueuedBy\":\"daniel.m@agapeny.com\",\"isOpen\":false,\"isTourSample\":false,\"withdrawnAt\":null,\"removedOfflineAt\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-19T14:42:05.939Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:53:09.714Z\"},\"attestationOutcome\":\"queued\",\"outcomeAt\":\"2026-05-22T12:29:10.031Z\",\"outcomeBy\":\"daniel.m@agapeny.com\",\"outcomeNote\":\"1. Re-attest the invoice.\"}]},{\"group\":{\"id\":1194,\"invoiceNumber\":\"1868653930\",\"clientNumber\":\"WA22723S\",\"errorDetails\":\"GPS destination too far from residence\",\"errorTypeId\":\"5\",\"errorTypeName\":\"GPS Destination Too Far from Medical Facility\",\"status\":\"Resolved\",\"outcome\":\"Approved\",\"phase\":\"closed\",\"phaseEnteredAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:40:12.848Z\",\"approvedAmount\":\"45.94\",\"rideCount\":2,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-05-01\",\"totalAmount\":\"45.94\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1868653930 - GPS Destination Too Far from Medical Facility (1 ride)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"GPS Destination Too Far from Residence\\\" flag on Conf #15059830 and requesting that this claim be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nThe flag does not reflect what the data shows. GPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and reasonably supports that the dropoff occurred at or near the member's residence, which directly contradicts the basis for the denial. This is not a true deviation from the authorized destination.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb trail documents the vehicle's path and confirms the dropoff location aligns with the member's home address. Based on this documentation, the edit should be overturned and the trip approved as a valid, completed service.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1868653930 - GPS Destination Too Far from Medical Facility (1 ride)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the \\\"GPS Destination Too Far from Residence\\\" flag on Conf #15059830 and requesting that this claim be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nThe flag does not reflect what the data shows. GPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and reasonably supports that the dropoff occurred at or near the member's residence, which directly contradicts the basis for the denial. This is not a true deviation from the authorized destination.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb trail documents the vehicle's path and confirms the dropoff location aligns with the member's home address. Based on this documentation, the edit should be overturned and the trip approved as a valid, completed service.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-21T17:29:05.690Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-21T17:32:49.244Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":\"You are disputing only Conf #15059830 (Car 1143, Client WA22723S, May 1, 2026) on Invoice #1868653930, seeking to overturn a \\\"GPS Destination Too Far from Residence\\\" finding. The GPS breadcrumb data for that leg is available and reasonably supports that the dropoff occurred at or near the member's residence, directly contradicting the flagged error. Conf #15059831 is not part of this dispute and should not be addressed in the write-up.\",\"understandingReadbackForText\":\"We are only disputing Conf # 15059830; the other leg is a non-issue and doesn't need to be mentioned. It was also reclassified and the error code is now \\\"GPS Destination Too Far from Residence\\\", so the error type coordinates with the trip being disputed.\",\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-21T17:29:05.690Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"krisalys.p@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":false,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-26T15:40:12.814Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"Grace@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":true,\"disputeEmailSentAt\":\"2026-05-21T18:00:36.387Z\",\"generatedEmailSubject\":null,\"generatedEmailBody\":null,\"generatedEmailAt\":null,\"evidenceFiles\":null,\"evidenceNotes\":null,\"evidenceChecklist\":null,\"payorEmail\":null,\"payorDenialReason\":null,\"payorDenialReasonNote\":null,\"payorDenialReasonAt\":null,\"payorDenialReasonBy\