QueuedAt\":\"2026-05-15T15:04:40.123Z\",\"attestationQueuedBy\":\"daniel.m@agapeny.com\",\"isOpen\":false,\"isTourSample\":false,\"withdrawnAt\":null,\"removedOfflineAt\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-28T14:06:10.549Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-05-15T15:05:12.901Z\"},\"attestationOutcome\":\"attested\",\"outcomeAt\":\"2026-05-15T15:05:12.901Z\",\"outcomeBy\":\"daniel.m@agapeny.com\",\"outcomeNote\":null}]},{\"group\":{\"id\":419,\"invoiceNumber\":\"1857311760\",\"clientNumber\":\"KY05151H\",\"errorDetails\":\"GPS pickup too far from residence; Travel time is too short for distance traveled; Leg is in GPS Deviation Status.\",\"errorTypeId\":\"6\",\"errorTypeName\":\"GPS Deviation Status\",\"status\":\"Resolved\",\"outcome\":\"Approved\",\"phase\":\"closed\",\"phaseEnteredAt\":\"2026-05-15T14:59:59.109Z\",\"approvedAmount\":\"147.49\",\"rideCount\":2,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-04-08\",\"totalAmount\":\"147.49\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1857311760 - GPS Deviation Status (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"**Reconsideration Request – GPS Deviation Status – Invoice #1857311760**\\n\\nWe are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flags on two trips under invoice #1857311760, Conf #14913596 and Conf #14913598, both serviced on 04/08/2026, and requesting that these claims be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor Conf #14913596 (Car 103), GPS breadcrumb data is available and confirms that pickup occurred at or reasonably near the member's residence. The flagged deviation does not reflect actual service conditions. For Conf #14913598 (Car 594), breadcrumb data similarly supports a valid route between pickup and dropoff, with travel time and distance consistent with a completed trip. Neither flag represents a true deviation from the authorized service.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb data is submitted as supporting evidence for both trips. For #14913596, the data demonstrates pickup proximity to the residence. For #14913598, the full route trace confirms the trip was completed as authorized. This documentation directly addresses and contradicts each of the stated denial reasons. Both trips are valid and should be approved in accordance with the evidence provided.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1857311760 - GPS Deviation Status (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Reconsideration Request – GPS Deviation Status – Invoice #1857311760**\\n\\nWe are disputing the GPS Deviation Status flags on two trips under invoice #1857311760, Conf #14913596 and Conf #14913598, both serviced on 04/08/2026, and requesting that these claims be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor Conf #14913596 (Car 103), GPS breadcrumb data is available and confirms that pickup occurred at or reasonably near the member's residence. The flagged deviation does not reflect actual service conditions. For Conf #14913598 (Car 594), breadcrumb data similarly supports a valid route between pickup and dropoff, with travel time and distance consistent with a completed trip. Neither flag represents a true deviation from the authorized service.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb data is submitted as supporting evidence for both trips. For #14913596, the data demonstrates pickup proximity to the residence. For #14913598, the full route trace confirms the trip was completed as authorized. This documentation directly addresses and contradicts each of the stated denial reasons. Both trips are valid and should be approved in accordance with the evidence provided.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-08T18:56:21.893Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-08T18:56:28.835Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-08T18:56:21.893Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequ