749Z on 04/28/2026. Based on this documentation, we request that the claim be approved in accordance with applicable guidelines.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1871146540 - Incomplete GPS (1 ride)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Dispute – Incomplete GPS – Conf #15074454**\\n\\nWe are disputing the Incomplete GPS flag on Conf #15074454 (Invoice #1871146540) and requesting that this claim be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for this trip and is sufficient to reasonably support trip completion. The denial does not reflect a true deviation, as the recorded data captures the route in a manner consistent with the service having been performed as authorized.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb data confirms the trip trajectory and supports that transport was completed for client UX13749Z on 04/28/2026. Based on this documentation, we request that the claim be approved in accordance with applicable guidelines.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T20:40:40.247Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"olveris.g@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T20:40:41.545Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"olveris.g@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-09T20:40:22.999Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"olveris.g@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-14T20:59:08.541Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"Grace@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closure