Context\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1792895920 - GPS Pickup Too Far from Residence (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the GPS Pickup Too Far from Residence flags on invoice 1792895920, covering Conf #15018947 and Conf #15018949, both serviced on 2026-04-25, and requesting that these trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor both legs, GPS breadcrumb data is available and was reviewed against the flagged pickup locations. On Conf #15018947, the breadcrumb trail reasonably supports that pickup occurred at or near the member's residence, indicating the flagged deviation does not reflect actual driver behavior. On Conf #15018949, the GPS route confirms a valid trip progression from pickup to drop-off, consistent with an authorized trip completed as scheduled. Neither leg reflects a true deviation when the available GPS data is taken into account.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb records for each confirmation number substantiate these conclusions. Based on this documentation, both trips were completed in compliance with applicable guidelines, and we request that the GPS deviation edits be cleared and these claims approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1792895920 - GPS Pickup Too Far from Residence (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the GPS Pickup Too Far from Residence flags on invoice 1792895920, covering Conf #15018947 and Conf #15018949, both serviced on 2026-04-25, and requesting that these trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nFor both legs, GPS breadcrumb data is available and was reviewed against the flagged pickup locations. On Conf #15018947, the breadcrumb trail reasonably supports that pickup occurred at or near the member's residence, indicating the flagged deviation does not reflect actual driver behavior. On Conf #15018949, the GPS route confirms a valid trip progression from pickup to drop-off, consistent with an authorized trip completed as scheduled. Neither leg reflects a true deviation when the available GPS data is taken into account.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb records for each confirmation number substantiate these conclusions. Based on this documentation, both trips were completed in compliance with applicable guidelines, and we request that the GPS deviation edits be cleared and these claims approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:06:38.961Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:06:38.961Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:06:38.961Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"emil.j@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-14T15:55:51.069Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":true,\"disputeEmailSentAt\":\"2026-05-09T23:31:03.591Z\",\"generatedEmailSubject\":null,\"generatedEmailBody\":null,\"generatedEmailAt\":null,\"evidenceFiles\":null,\"evidenceNotes\":null,\"evidenceChecklist\":null,\"payorEmail\":null,\"payorDenialReason\":null,\"payorDenialReasonNote\":null,\"payorDenialReasonAt\":null,\"payorDenialReasonBy\":null,\"awaitingPayorAgainAt\