3:36.416Z\",\"approvedAmount\":\"70.06\",\"rideCount\":2,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-04-25\",\"totalAmount\":\"70.06\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1865422570 - Incomplete GPS (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the Incomplete GPS flags on invoice 1865422570 for Conf #15019359 and Conf #15019366 and requesting that both claims be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for both trips and has been reviewed against the routes as authorized. The data captured for each trip is sufficient to reasonably support full trip completion, meaning this flag does not reflect a true deviation for either confirmation.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb records for both Conf #15019359 (Car 4919, 2026-04-25) and Conf #15019366 (Car 855, 2026-04-25) demonstrate that each trip was conducted along the appropriate route and completed as scheduled. Based on this documentation, both trips are valid and we request that the claims be approved in accordance with applicable guidelines.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1865422570 - Incomplete GPS (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"We are disputing the Incomplete GPS flags on invoice 1865422570 for Conf #15019359 and Conf #15019366 and requesting that both claims be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for both trips and has been reviewed against the routes as authorized. The data captured for each trip is sufficient to reasonably support full trip completion, meaning this flag does not reflect a true deviation for either confirmation.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb records for both Conf #15019359 (Car 4919, 2026-04-25) and Conf #15019366 (Car 855, 2026-04-25) demonstrate that each trip was conducted along the appropriate route and completed as scheduled. Based on this documentation, both trips are valid and we request that the claims be approved in accordance with applicable guidelines.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEdite