 requesting reconsideration of both affected trips: Conf #15063813 and Conf #15063814, both serviced on 04/27/2026.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for each trip and is sufficient to reasonably support completion of service. The denial does not reflect a true deviation -- both trips have traceable route data that aligns with the authorized service for client NU61644Y.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb records for vehicles 4498 and 4936 confirm that each trip was completed as authorized. Based on this documentation, these are valid trips and we request that both claims be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1869511660 - Incomplete GPS (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Dispute – Incomplete GPS – Invoice #1869511660 (Conf #15063813 & #15063814)**\\n\\nWe are disputing the Incomplete GPS flag on invoice #1869511660 and requesting reconsideration of both affected trips: Conf #15063813 and Conf #15063814, both serviced on 04/27/2026.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for each trip and is sufficient to reasonably support completion of service. The denial does not reflect a true deviation -- both trips have traceable route data that aligns with the authorized service for client NU61644Y.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb records for vehicles 4498 and 4936 confirm that each trip was completed as authorized. Based on this documentation, these are valid trips and we request that both claims be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T18:42:23.444Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T18:42:24.589Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-09T18:42:04.960Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt