es)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"Reconsideration Request – Incomplete GPS – Invoice #1844497880\\n\\nWe are disputing the \\\"Incomplete GPS\\\" flag on invoice #1844497880 and requesting reconsideration of both affected trips: Conf #15028151 and Conf #15028152, both serviced on 04/27/2026.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for each trip and is sufficient to reasonably support completion of service. The denial does not reflect a true deviation -- both routes are documented through continuous location tracking that aligns with the authorized origin and destination for each leg.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb records for vehicles 2600 and 3964 confirm that each trip was completed as dispatched. Based on this documentation, these are valid, completed transports and we request that both confirmations be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1844497880 - Incomplete GPS (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Reconsideration Request – Incomplete GPS – Invoice #1844497880**\\n\\nWe are disputing the \\\"Incomplete GPS\\\" flag on invoice #1844497880 and requesting reconsideration of both affected trips: Conf #15028151 and Conf #15028152, both serviced on 04/27/2026.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for each trip and is sufficient to reasonably support completion of service. The denial does not reflect a true deviation -- both routes are documented through continuous location tracking that aligns with the authorized origin and destination for each leg.\\n\\nThe attached GPS breadcrumb records for vehicles 2600 and 3964 confirm that each trip was completed as dispatched. Based on this documentation, these are valid, completed transports and we request that both confirmations be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T19:00:14.341Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T19:00:15.041Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"KATIA.H@AGAPENY.COM\",\"specialCircumstances\"