does not indicate a true short-stay deviation. The denial does not accurately represent what occurred on either trip.\\n\\nTiming documentation for both confirmation numbers is attached and supports that services were rendered as authorized. Based on this evidence and applicable guidelines, these are valid, completed trips and we request that both be approved accordingly.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1863576910 - Time at Medical Facility Too Short (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Reconsideration Request – Time at Medical Facility Too Short – Invoice #1863576910**\\n\\nWe are disputing the \\\"Time at Medical Facility Too Short\\\" edit on invoice #1863576910 and requesting reconsideration of both affected trips, Conf #14988698 and Conf #14988697, both serviced on 2026-04-16.\\n\\nFor each trip, GPS and timing data are available and have been reviewed. That data does not support the flag -- in both cases, the recorded facility time reasonably reflects the actual visit duration and does not indicate a true short-stay deviation. The denial does not accurately represent what occurred on either trip.\\n\\nTiming documentation for both confirmation numbers is attached and supports that services were rendered as authorized. Based on this evidence and applicable guidelines, these are valid, completed trips and we request that both be approved accordingly.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-09T17:19:33.137Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"oliver.g@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-09T17:19:36.568Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"oliver.g@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":\"none\",\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-09T17:19:33.137Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"oliver.g@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-14T12:38:23.120Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":\"daniel.m@agapen