22Y\",\"errorDetails\":\"GPS pickup too far from medical facility\",\"errorTypeId\":\"4\",\"errorTypeName\":\"GPS Pickup Too Far from Medical Facility\",\"status\":\"Resolved\",\"outcome\":\"Approved\",\"phase\":\"closed\",\"phaseEnteredAt\":\"2026-05-07T00:50:57.113Z\",\"approvedAmount\":\"131.12\",\"rideCount\":2,\"serviceDate\":\"2026-04-07\",\"totalAmount\":\"131.12\",\"groupContext\":null,\"draftSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1858911480 - GPS Pickup Too Far from Medical Facility (2 rides)\",\"draftDescriptionHtml\":\"**Subject: Dispute – GPS Pickup Too Far from Medical Facility – Invoice #1858911480**\\n\\nWe are disputing the GPS Pickup Too Far from Medical Facility flag on Invoice #1858911480, covering Conf #14935090 and Conf #14935091 (both serviced on 04/07/2026), and requesting that these trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for both rides and confirms that pickup occurred at or near the medical facility in each case. The flagged deviation does not reflect what actually took place -- the breadcrumb trail reasonably supports the documented pickup locations, and no true deviation exists for either trip.\\n\\nBased on the available GPS data, these are valid, completed trips and should be approved in accordance with standard documentation guidelines.\",\"aiBaselineSubject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1858911480 - GPS Pickup Too Far from Medical Facility (2 rides)\",\"aiBaselineDescriptionHtml\":\"**Subject: Dispute – GPS Pickup Too Far from Medical Facility – Invoice #1858911480**\\n\\nWe are disputing the GPS Pickup Too Far from Medical Facility flag on Invoice #1858911480, covering Conf #14935090 and Conf #14935091 (both serviced on 04/07/2026), and requesting that these trips be reconsidered for approval.\\n\\nGPS breadcrumb data is available for both rides and confirms that pickup occurred at or near the medical facility in each case. The flagged deviation does not reflect what actually took place -- the breadcrumb trail reasonably supports the documented pickup locations, and no true deviation exists for either trip.\\n\\nBased on the available GPS data, these are valid, completed trips and should be approved in accordance with standard documentation guidelines.\",\"draftAttribution\":null,\"draftEditedAt\":\"2026-05-06T15:41:42.454Z\",\"draftEditedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"draftReviewedAt\":\"2026-05-06T15:41:47.833Z\",\"draftReviewedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"specialCircumstances\":null,\"understandingReadback\":null,\"understandingReadbackForText\":null,\"understandingReadbackAt\":null,\"understandingReadbackBy\":null,\"previewGeneratedAt\":\"2026-05-06T15:41:42.454Z\",\"previewGeneratedBy\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"reattestRequired\":true,\"reattestCompletedAt\":\"2026-05-08T20:05:47.334Z\",\"reattestCompletedBy\":null,\"reattestNote\":null,\"holdReason\":null,\"holdPendingFrom\":null,\"holdPlacedAt\":null,\"triageNotes\":null,\"triagedAt\":null,\"closureReason\":\"reattested\",\"closureCategory\":null,\"closureCategoryOther\":null,\"closureRootCause\":null,\"closureRootCauseOther\":null,\"closureNarrative\":null,\"closureAccountabilityTags\":null,\"closureAccountabilityOther\":null,\"closureDrivers\":null,\"closureDispatchers\":null,\"closureCommunicatedTo\":null,\"closureResponsibility\":null,\"closureReviewState\":null,\"closureAddressedAt\":null,\"closureAddressedBy\":null,\"closureAddressedByEmail\":null,\"closureReviewNotes\":null,\"disputeEmailSent\":true,\"disputeEmailSentAt\":\"2026-05-06T18:00:25.303Z\",\"generatedEmailSubject\":null,\"generatedEmailBody\":null,\"generatedEmailAt\":null,\"evidenceFiles\":null,\"evidenceNotes\":null,\"evidenceChecklist\":null,\"payorEmail\":null,\"payorDenialReason\":null,\"payorDenialReasonNote\":null,\"payorDenialReasonAt\":null,\"payorDenialReasonBy\":null,\"awaitingPayorAgainAt\":null,\"importBatch\":\"import_1777385152477\",\"isTourSample\":false,\"withdrawnAt\":null,\"draftDiscardedAt\":null,\"draftDiscardedSubject\":