 Queued\",\"from\":\"New\",\"reason\":\"Portal submission created and queued\",\"source\":\"portal_submission_create\"},\"userEmail\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"userName\":null,\"idempotencyKey\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-20T17:43:12.229Z\"},{\"id\":27222,\"claimId\":3241,\"invoiceGroupId\":1762,\"action\":\"portal_submission_confirmed\",\"details\":\"Portal submission #1673 confirmed\",\"metadata\":{\"lintWarnings\":[],\"submissionId\":1673,\"lintWarningsAcknowledged\":false},\"userEmail\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"userName\":null,\"idempotencyKey\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-20T17:43:12.151Z\"},{\"id\":27221,\"claimId\":null,\"invoiceGroupId\":1762,\"action\":\"group_draft_reviewed\",\"details\":\"Dispute draft marked reviewed\",\"metadata\":null,\"userEmail\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"userName\":null,\"idempotencyKey\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-20T17:43:09.994Z\"},{\"id\":27220,\"claimId\":null,\"invoiceGroupId\":1762,\"action\":\"group_preview_generated\",\"details\":\"Dispute preview generated\",\"metadata\":{\"hasPerLegContext\":false,\"hasSopTranscript\":true,\"descriptionLength\":1030,\"perLegContextLegCount\":0,\"siblingDuplicateCount\":0,\"sopTranscriptLegCount\":2},\"userEmail\":\"someidy.s@agapeny.com\",\"userName\":null,\"idempotencyKey\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-20T17:43:04.974Z\"}],\"responses\":[{\"id\":2330,\"claimId\":null,\"invoiceGroupId\":1762,\"submissionId\":1673,\"source\":\"portal\",\"responseType\":\"approval\",\"subject\":\"Dispute - Invoice #1877954550 - GPS Deviation Status (2 rides) #92295\",\"content\":\"GPS Exemption Request Approved\\nA detailed review of the GPS data received for invoice 1877954550 confirmed GPS compliance despite the event IDs submitted via GPS being incorrect.\\nImportant Notice:\\nThe GPS Deviation on this trip may have been caused by:\\n\\nUser error - Your company should provide training for drivers on proper GPS application utilization\\n\\nTPI software issues - If using third-party software, share this information with your TPI\\n\\nYour GPS Exemption Request for 1877954550 is approved.\\nThe invoice will be made attestable within two business days.\\n\\nNote: Exceptions granted for user error or TPI software issues will not be available indefinitely. Please work to resolve these issues.\\n \\n \\n\\n document.querySelectorAll('.portal-attachment-thumbnail-img').forEach(function(img) {\\n img.addEventListener('error', function () {\\n attachment_error_image(this);\\n });\\n });\\n\\n const attachment_error_image = (attachment) => {\\n const parentElement = attachment.parentElement;\\n const defaultIcon = `${escapeHtml(attachment.dataset.extension)}`;\\n parentElement.innerHTML = defaultIcon;\\n };\",\"rawContent\":\"GPS Exemption Request Approved\\nA detailed review of the GPS data received for invoice 1877954550 confirmed GPS compliance despite the event IDs submitted via GPS being incorrect.\\nImportant Notice:\\nThe GPS Deviation on this trip may have been caused by:\\n\\nUser error - Your company should provide training for drivers on proper GPS application utilization\\n\\nTPI software issues - If using third-party software, share this information with your TPI\\n\\nYour GPS Exemption Request for 1877954550 is approved.\\nThe invoice will be made attestable within two business days.\\n\\nNote: Exceptions granted for user error or TPI software issues will not be available indefinitely. Please work to resolve these issues.\\n \\n \\n\\n document.querySelectorAll('.portal-attachment-thumbnail-img').forEach(function(img) {\\n img.addEventListener('error', function () {\\n attachment_error_image(this);\\n });\\n });\\n\\n const attachment_error_image = (attachment) => {\\n const parentElement = attachment.parentElement;\\n const defaultIcon = `${escapeHtml(attachment.dataset.extension)}`;\\n parentElement.innerHTML = defaultIcon;\\n };\",\"bodyFormat\":\"text\",\"senderEmail\":null,\"senderName\":\"Transportation Provider\",\"matchedVia\":\"portal_ticke